  "claim": "The former college football quarterback Julius Caesar \"J. C.\" Watts Jr. is the nephew Wade Watts.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Wade Watts. Sentence: He worked with Thurgood Marshall and developed a friendship with Martin Luther King during the American civil rights movement, and has been cited as a mentor by the current leader of the NAACP in Oklahoma, Miller Newman, and his nephew, former congressman, J. C. Watts.\nPage: J. C. Watts. Sentence: Julius Caesar \"J. C.\" Watts Jr. (born November 18, 1957) is an American politician from Oklahoma who was a college football quarterback for the Oklahoma Sooners and later played professionally in the Canadian Football League.",
